# Targets chezmoi deletes on apply.
#
# XDG autostart leftovers from the KDE setup. uwsm runs XDG autostart entries
# too, so with these in place Discord and Steam each launch twice -- once from
# here and once from hypr/autostart.lua, which is where they are now defined
# (with their workspace placement).
#
# Listed here rather than deleted once because both applications rewrite the
# file whenever their in-app "launch on startup" option is toggled. If they
# keep coming back, turn that setting off inside Discord and Steam as well --
# this only cleans up after them.
.config/autostart/discord.desktop
.config/autostart/steam.desktop
